Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.97,0:00:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,YUM! YUM!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.21,0:00:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,YUM! וי!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,YUM!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.33,0:01:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling monkey boy, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.11,0:01:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No one talks like that to Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.91,0:01:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.29,0:01:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.13,0:01:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.13,0:01:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're back on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.47,0:01:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I was freaking out about you. No joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.49,0:01:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.43,0:01:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've got bigger things to\Nworry about than little old Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.91,0:01:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget me, handsome, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.27,0:01:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.49,0:01:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai! Mai!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.85,0:01:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.07,0:01:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.31,0:01:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.43,0:01:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you back from the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.87,0:02:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.43,0:02:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow I can understand the Egyptian\Ntext on the winged dragon of Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My computer network\Ncouldn't even translate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.89,0:02:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I just need to win it from Marek!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.97,0:02:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,In this shadow duel, the loser will\Nhave to pay the ultimate price.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.49,0:02:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be no laughter once I've\Nbanished you to the shadow realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.37,0:02:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be the one who's\Nliving in eternal darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.45,0:02:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This fool has already felt the\Nwrath of an Egyptian god core.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The attack devastated him, so he\Nwas unconscious when I played mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.37,0:02:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Winged Dragon of Ra, attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:02:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He completely missed my\Ndemonstration of the unstoppable
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,powers of the Winged Dragon\Nof Ra in my last duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.39,0:03:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So my opponent has no idea how\Nmy Egyptian god card works.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't know what to do\Nwhen Ra unleashes its rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.43,0:03:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Or will he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.05,0:03:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.55,0:03:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the dueling experience\Nof my weaker self to call upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.15,0:03:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.35,0:03:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you've learned everything\Nyou know about dueling from him,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,that means I know your strategy\Nand your deck inside and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.97,0:03:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two are in for quite a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.85,0:03:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they discover I've changed most\Nof the cards in my dueling deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.91,0:03:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't think I'm unaware of the\NEgyptian god card you now hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.53,0:03:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because that fool\NMarek is dueling on your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.81,0:03:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,side doesn't mean you're\Nsafe from the fury of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.21,0:03:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,For when I'm through with you two, you're\Nboth certain to end up in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.87,0:03:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we start,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:04:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,there's someone here who would like to\Nhave a few words with you face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.37,0:04:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I will win my body back from you\Nbecause destiny is on my side. Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.21,0:04:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've taken over your\Ndestiny now, and with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.01,0:04:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I plan to claim the great\Npower of the Pharaoh for
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,myself while you two fools\Nwallow in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you claim my fate\Nas your own, body snatcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.39,0:04:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the real you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and soon you'll be nothing but a\Nforgotten memory in the sands of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,While I was occupying Teya's mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Ashizu tell the\Nstory of the first day
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.05,0:04:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You were born. My brother\NMerrick wasn't always evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.35,0:04:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She explained that after I received\Nthe Tomb Keeper's initiation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.79,0:04:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,the seeds of your existence\Nwere planted And it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,was you who began my path\Ntowards darkness when
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you sent my father to the\NShadow Realm Soon you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:05:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,pay for what you did to\Nme and to him What I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.37,0:05:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born out of your hate,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.49,0:05:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,your jealousy, and your\Nanger towards your father,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.09,0:05:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,which makes you just as guilty as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be, but from now on, I'll\Nmake up for everything I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.47,0:05:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Very touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.97,0:05:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You have taken your first step, Marek,\Non a dangerous path of ultimate darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you must turn back\Nbefore it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the pharaoh will return. Turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.99,0:05:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon shielded me from the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.03,0:05:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and for years I believed it was that\Nstranger who destroyed my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.41,0:05:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I know better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say you're a little late\Nto do anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.11,0:05:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Once this duel's over and you're\Ngone, revenge will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Without me, you won't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.27,0:05:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears there are some secrets\Nthat Marek has kept from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if he wants my help,\Nit will cost him dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stand back and do as I say. Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's business to discuss first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you to reclaim your\Nbody, but I have a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If we win the duel, I'll\Ngive you the Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.69,0:06:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our old deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.31,0:06:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I need more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that I heard about you\Nseeking the power of the pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a magic stronger\Nthan that of the seven
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.45,0:06:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,millennium items that you\Nhaven't told me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.51,0:06:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know what secrets\Nyou're keeping from me, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.25,0:06:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me everything and we have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.91,0:06:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If we win, I'll tell you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.77,0:06:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't trust you at all, but\Nthis time I know you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.91,0:06:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard your better half, you fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now prepare for a one-way\Ntrip to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.07,0:06:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you're a bit confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.51,0:07:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bring the\Ndarkness of the Shadow Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.29,0:07:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,right here so it can\Nconsume you piece by piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.85,0:07:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackness, surround us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.79,0:07:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for a battle like no other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,For in this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.25,0:07:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the eternal darkness of\Nthe Shadow Realm will
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.93,0:07:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,slowly devour the loser as\Nhis life points diminish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.59,0:07:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.79,0:07:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.63,0:07:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, let the destruction commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the cards in my deck are\Nalready showing you no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercy is for the weak,\Nlike you, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.97,0:07:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, I'll place this face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I shall summon the terrifying\Ngoblin zombie in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.39,0:07:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared yet? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Scared of that? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.51,0:07:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place a card face\Ndown and summon Drilago!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.57,0:08:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.15,0:08:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You've activated my trap\Ncard, Fearful Earthbound!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.83,0:08:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, your first mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.69,0:08:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your first of many.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.63,0:08:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.15,0:08:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you wouldn't be able\Nto resist attacking my zombie,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.63,0:08:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and now I'm going to punish you for your\Nfatal error by weakening your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.61,0:08:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,When this trap card's activated,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.79,0:08:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the opposing duelist\Nautomatically loses 500
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.51,0:08:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,life points each time his monster attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.61,0:08:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Like now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.19,0:08:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still sending your\Nmonster to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.55,0:08:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to destroy my weak\Nmonsters whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.93,0:08:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only will you lose life points, but\Nwith each monster you send to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.89,0:08:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I grow stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.95,0:08:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you will feel\Nthe effect of my fearful
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.11,0:08:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,earthbound as it lowers\Nyour life points by 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.23,0:09:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Guess again. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.79,0:09:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate remove trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.39,0:09:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My magic card has eliminated\Nyour pathetic trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.35,0:09:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take more than a\Nmagic card to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be true, but from the looks\Nof your arm, it's a start. My arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.89,0:09:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're the one\Nwho's about to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.45,0:09:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done to my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's vanishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.19,0:09:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, you weren't listening\Nto what I said earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.11,0:09:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.11,0:09:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You just lost 500 life\Npoints. And as they fade away,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,so will small portions of your body Until
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,the Shadow Realm claims\Nall of you You fiend
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the darkness will feed\Non your soul for all eternity
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.03,0:10:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quite familiar with how the\NShadow Realm operates Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It is you who shall disappear into\Nthe darkness. Don't be a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can win as long\Nas I control the ultimate weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.41,0:10:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the Winged Dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.33,0:10:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, for with the help of your\Nother half, I will certainly prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Only fools rely on the\Nhelp of the desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.03,0:10:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait, you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.59,0:10:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This stuff looks familiar, but\Nwhere have I seen it before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.47,0:10:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.89,0:10:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the inside of my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the door to Yami's side!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.29,0:11:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been in there once before,\Nand it was really dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.31,0:11:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe I can find some\Nclues to the ancient past.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a complex mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.55,0:11:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember seeing\Nthis many levels before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.13,0:11:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There are false starts\Nand dead ends everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.23,0:11:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.77,0:11:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry if I disturbed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.47,0:11:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind must have been restless\Nto have brought you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.69,0:11:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I am a little worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.53,0:11:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.55,0:11:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it seems like things are getting out\Nof hand lately, and the danger's growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.39,0:11:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.33,0:11:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It grows as we near our destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.19,0:11:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why I'm starting\Nto understand this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know why it's so complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.39,0:11:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All these confusing paths,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.63,0:11:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,they represent all the\Nmysteries of your past
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.73,0:11:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and all the questions you\Nhave about the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.91,0:11:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yami, I know we're going to\Nfigure all of this out soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not going to let\Nanyone stand in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.21,0:12:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have struck first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.19,0:12:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll have the last laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And the joke will be on you. Now then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.07,0:12:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter which\Ncard you play next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know your deck very well, and\Nnone of your moves will surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.95,0:12:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, I witnessed your last tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.93,0:12:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's familiar with my cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.31,0:12:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll be expecting me to use my\Ndestiny board as I did last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.03,0:12:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid he's in for a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Stalling won't help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.65,0:12:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It will just delay the\Nappearance of my winged
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.55,0:12:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon of Ra and his assured destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.83,0:12:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.57,0:12:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Anxious to lose, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.37,0:12:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He has only one monster on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.93,0:12:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,so even if the winged dragon\Nof Ra is already in his hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.91,0:12:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.23,0:12:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,For he must sacrifice three monsters\Nbefore he can summon his Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ra is no threat. Trust me. Keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.41,0:13:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.19,0:13:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,In my mind lies the secret of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You can argue when you're\Nboth in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, whatever you're\Nplanning won't work anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.47,0:13:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That just might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.81,0:13:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You do realize that the scheme you just\Ntold me works, and we defeat this demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.79,0:13:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,you may lose your body in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.23,0:13:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll risk it. Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.63,0:13:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them conspire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.33,0:13:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't do them any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.03,0:13:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place two cards face down, and\NI'll summon Garnia in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.61,0:13:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try to tear him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.07,0:13:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he trying to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.59,0:13:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.07,0:13:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My Egyptian god card will\Ndefeat him regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.49,0:13:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, once I draw the weak\Ndragon of Ra into my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.14,0:13:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This card will help me get what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the card of sanctity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.47,0:14:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What does your magic card do? Simple,\Nwe must keep drawing until we both
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,hold six cards this should help me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.65,0:14:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,immensely no sounds to me like you didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.09,0:14:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Draw what you needed. Fortunately, I\Ncan give you one more chance at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.41,0:14:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,that is if you don't mind my help open\Nface down card multiple destruction
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.73,0:14:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.37,0:14:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My trap card forces both players to\Ndiscard their hands to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,then lets us draw five\Nnew cards from our dex.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, there is a\Ndownside to playing this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The duelist who uses it loses 100 life\Npoints for each card he throws away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.01,0:14:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he destroying himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.35,0:14:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's stalling now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.99,0:14:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.83,0:14:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Still no winged dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.81,0:14:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.15,0:15:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you still haven't\Ndrawn the card you need yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.09,0:15:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.41,0:15:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You just worry about my face down, Cor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.23,0:15:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.91,0:15:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.63,0:15:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what happened\Nlast time you were here, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.07,0:15:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A stranger appeared to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.55,0:15:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.09,0:15:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He used the power of his Millennium Key\Nto see into the maze of my inner mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He was searching for the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.85,0:15:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you may enter, but I\Nwarn you to tread cautiously.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Even he couldn't find any answers in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.39,0:15:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,for behind every door was another\Nmental trap, hiding the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Shadi had no better luck than I've had\Ntrying to solve the mysteries in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.73,0:15:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I climbed these staircases and\Nentered these doors just as Shadi has.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.89,0:15:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but to no avail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.31,0:15:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But he hasn't given up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.05,0:15:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he appeared to us on the blimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.73,0:16:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You've learned much since we first\Nmet in Duelist Kingdom, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.25,0:16:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're beginning to understand your\Nfate and its relation to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.59,0:16:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what Marik said?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.49,0:16:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He told us the secret to\Nunlocking the Pharaoh's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.95,0:16:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,power was imprinted on his\Nback during a ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.47,0:16:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, perhaps he holds the\Nanswers we have been looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.95,0:16:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I make a great team, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.91,0:16:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And together we have to defeat Merrick\Nand unlock that power before he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't do it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.49,0:16:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be there for you. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.71,0:16:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting away to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.01,0:16:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That will soon change. I draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.19,0:16:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.10,0:16:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the card I was waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.13,0:16:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I shall sacrifice Kurnia in\Norder to summon my dreaded Puppet Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I mention my new\Nmonster's special ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,For the bargain price of\Na thousand life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.09,0:17:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,my puppet monster allows me to bring\Nthree monsters back from the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.31,0:17:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you forgot to mention\None important fact, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monsters can't attack this turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said I was going to attack with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.27,0:17:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something far more ingenious in mind\Nwith a little help from this card. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.01,0:17:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate the magic card, Dark Designator.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.19,0:17:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I care about a\Nmagic card that lets you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.87,0:17:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,choose one monster from my\Ndeck and place it in my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.77,0:17:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless... Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.17,0:17:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I am forcing you to draw\Nthe winged dragon of Ra
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.03,0:17:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,into your hand so I can\Nthen claim it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.43,0:17:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now enjoy it while you can\Nfor soon it will be mine
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.99,0:17:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,don't be so sure i'm on to\Nyour plan and i can assure
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.41,0:17:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you you'll fail your sad\Nattempt to steal raw was
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.73,0:17:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,obvious you laid it all out\Nfor me on the field you fool
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,it's all there the three\Nuseless monsters you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,summoned for 1 000 life\Npoints the face down card
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.09,0:18:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,you're waiting to\Nactivate too bad that card
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.43,0:18:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,will never leave my hands don't\Nbe too I'm sure, you demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.35,0:18:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my face down card, Exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.81,0:18:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you must know its effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.65,0:18:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When Exchange is played, each duelist\Ntakes a card from the other's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.01,0:18:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So please hand over\Nyour weak dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.11,0:18:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.57,0:18:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.23,0:18:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you pick a card, any card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster Reborn should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be quite hard to part with your\Nmost powerful card, but don't feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It may seem like you've just\Nlost your Egyptian God card,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can promise that you will\Nbe seeing it again very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.13,0:19:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get excited just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.09,0:19:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're forgetting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.63,0:19:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't control the power of Ra,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.09,0:19:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,which means the card is\Nabsolutely useless to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But not to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.27,0:19:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The winged dragon of Ra may be\Ncontrolled by anyone who can
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.89,0:19:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,decipher and recite the ancient\Ntext that's inscribed on the card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.63,0:19:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look who's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.27,0:19:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the spirit of the\Nring isn't duelist enough to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.33,0:19:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,handle me without running to\Nhis little friend for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't push me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need more than that\Nweakling's help to defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.85,0:19:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.81,0:19:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, my partner\Nknows everything you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.85,0:19:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, he is your other half.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.25,0:19:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Raw, I am complete without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.41,0:19:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You are nothing and soon\Nyou won't exist at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,One more turn to go and the winged dragon\Nof Raw will cast you to the shadow.
